<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3804/09  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.7450/60  German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.9636/46  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.4610/20  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     36.00/01   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.8791/13  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1698.1/9.1 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     114.62/67  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     7.7185/35  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     7.3257/77  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.6406/26  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>One sterling     US$1.6647/52</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$333.70/20</p>
</text>
